message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. A paper describing it is in preparation; cite it once published."
title: "volumetric-contact"
abstract: >-
  Engine-independent C++20 library of volumetric contact force laws (Gonthier's model and a
  distributed Winkler foundation integrated over the exact contact surface), with Drake, Chrono and
  MuJoCo backends and a battery of analytic benchmark scenarios.
